  "gloss": "to be stylish; to be fashionable; to dress up",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to be stylish; to be fashionable; to be chic",
      "explanation": "To have a refined, tasteful, or fashionable quality. Most commonly used in its past participle form しゃれた as a modifier."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
